  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Grants 20% Damage Resistance while overcharging a <void/>Void Grenade with <void/>Chaos Accelerant.\n\nOvercharged Grenade Hits apply <void/>Weaken for 6 seconds and grant additional base grenade Regeneration Rate depending on the equipped grenade for 1.75 seconds.\n\n• Axion: <pve 5000% /> <pvp [4000%] /> \n• Scatter: <pve 3700% /> <pvp [2700%] />\n• Vortex: <pve 3400% /> <pvp [2400%] />\n• Handheld Supernova: <pve 2500% /> <pvp [2000%] />\n\n4 second cooldown between activations, which is removed on grenade usage. Grants between 50-60% Grenade energy per activation.\n\n<void/>Vortex Grenades can proc twice if enemies get hit by the initial explosion and the last few ticks.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-12T19:19:52.962Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
